    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23836" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκά-λιτρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weighing</i> or <i>worth
				ten</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίτραι, στατήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				510
			</span></i>: as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκάλιτρον,
					τό,</span>
			<i>coin worth ten</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίτραι, ὁ μισθὸς δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sophr.
					37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.81
			</span></i>.</div>
